
<!-- ================= TOP TITLE ================= -->
<section class="container py-5">

  <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 900px; text-align: center;">

    <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-4">
      Wedding Braces
    </h1>

    <p class="lead leadtext mb-4">
      Do you want your smile to look its best on your wedding day? Are you worried that your braces may show in your wedding pictures?
    </p>

    <p class="mb-4">
      We aim to deliver you the best smile for your wedding. Our Wedding Package involves consultations with our Multi-Speciality Team, including; an Orthodontic Specialist, a Crown, Veneer and Whitening Specialist, and a Gum Specialist.
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- ================= HERO IMAGE ================= -->
<div class="treatment-hero-fullwidth">
  <%= image_tag "treatments/wedding_braces.jpg",
      class: "treatment-hero-img",
      alt: "Wedding Braces" %>
</div>

<!-- ================= CONTENT BLOCK ================= -->
<section class="container py-5">

  <div class="mx-auto" style="max-width: 900px;">

    <p>
      To cope with the challenges of wedding photos, Redhead Orthodontics recommends using a Hidden Lingual Brace.
    </p>

    <p>
      Lingual braces begin to straighten the teeth from day one, and within three months you will see an improvement.
    </p>

    <p class="fw-bold mt-4 mb-2">
      Incognito Lingual Braces
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li>Completely invisible from the outside</li>
      <li>Excellent results for all types of incorrect tooth positions</li>
      <li>Custom designed wires & brackets- improved comfort and fast results</li>
      <li>Made from polished gold – no nickel allergies</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mt-3">
      Or choose Invisalign aligners or our discreet clear glass braces.
    </p>

    <p class="mt-4">
      Still, confused about which brace to choose?
    </p>

  </div>

</section>

<!-- ================= CTA SECTION ================= -->
<section class="container text-center py-4">

  <a href="/quiz" class="btn-red me-2">
    TAKE THE QUIZ
  </a>

  <a href="/contact" class="btn-blue">
    MAKE AN APPOINTMENT
  </a>

</section>

<%= render "appointments/form", appointment: @appointment %>
<%= render "proud_members" %>
<%= render "footer" %>

<style>
.treatment-hero-fullwidth {
  width: 100%;
  margin: 40px 0;
}

.treatment-hero-img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 450px;
  object-fit: cover;
  display: block;
}
</style>
